{
  "name": "Second Brain – Automation Webhook Receiver",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚡ Automation webhook receiver\nTujuan aksi **Kirim webhook** di halaman *Automations* app. App mengirim `POST` JSON `{ text, content, rule, event, project, task }` (lihat `src/server/automationEngine.server.ts`; wajib https, dicek SSRF guard).\n\nURL yang ditempel di app:\n`https://<n8n>/webhook/second-brain-automation?token=<SB_AUTOMATION_WEBHOOK_TOKEN>&channel=telegram`\n`channel` = `telegram` | `sheets` | `discord` | `all`\n\nFan-out bawaan: Telegram admin, Google Sheets (log, disabled), Discord/Slack (disabled). Tambahkan cabang sendiri (Notion, email, dsb.).\nBalasan 200 dikirim segera agar `automation_runs` tercatat `ok`; token salah → 401 (tercatat gagal).\n\n**Env:** `SB_AUTOMATION_WEBHOOK_TOKEN`, `SB_TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN`, `SB_TELEGRAM_ADMIN_CHAT_ID`, `SB_DISCORD_WEBHOOK_URL` (opsional), `SB_APP_URL` (untuk link).",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 720,
        "color": "6"
      },
      "id": "94090b20-dd95-41ac-b799-ccc471ff651b",
      "name": "Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-60, -440]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "second-brain-automation",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "fdd2c143-e9cb-4cef-ba0d-1920be1b681a",
      "name": "Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [0, 100],
      "webhookId": "8b02034a-6911-4364-b7b1-ca8757d41bfe"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Validasi token rahasia (query ?token=...) — aksi \"Kirim webhook\" di app tidak mengirim header auth,\n// jadi token disematkan di URL yang Anda tempel di halaman Automations.\nconst expected = String($env.SB_AUTOMATION_WEBHOOK_TOKEN || '');\nconst q = $json.query || {};\nconst b = $json.body || {};\n// Perbandingan panjang-konstan sederhana (token di URL; tetap pakai string acak ≥ 32 karakter).\nconst given = String(q.token || '');\nlet diff = given.length ^ expected.length;\nfor (let i = 0; i < expected.length; i++) diff |= expected.charCodeAt(i) ^ given.charCodeAt(i % Math.max(given.length, 1));\nif (!expected || diff !== 0) return [{ json: { ok: false, reason: 'unauthorized' } }];\nconst t = b.task || {};\nconst due = t.due_date ? new Date(t.due_date).toLocaleString('id-ID', { timeZone: $env.GENERIC_TIMEZONE || 'Asia/Jakarta', dateStyle: 'medium', timeStyle: 'short' }) : '-';\nconst link = $env.SB_APP_URL ? `${$env.SB_APP_URL}/tasks?task=${t.id || ''}` : '';\nreturn [{ json: {\n  ok: true,\n  channel: String(q.channel || 'telegram'),\n  rule: b.rule || '-', event: b.event || '-', project: b.project || '-',\n  task: { id: t.id, title: t.title, status: t.status, priority: t.priority, assignee: t.assignee_name, due, tags: t.tags || [] },\n  text: `⚡ ${b.rule || 'Automation'} (${b.event || '-'})\\n📌 ${t.title || '-'}\\nStatus: ${t.status || '-'} · Prioritas: ${t.priority || '-'}\\nProyek: ${b.project || '-'} · Tenggat: ${due}${link ? `\\n${link}` : ''}`,\n} }];"
      },
      "id": "223cfbb3-e007-44a9-9c5d-f52f563f7cdb",
      "name": "Validasi & format",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [220, 100]
    },
